{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"albert-einstein","categoryLabel":"阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦","chapterCount":3,"docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.94,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/11_albert-einstein/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"阿尔伯特-爱因斯坦-代表成就\">阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦·代表成就</h1><p>1905 年，一位在伯尔尼专利局工作、当时还籍籍无名的二等技术专家，在短短数月内向《物理年鉴》连续投出四篇论文。这一年后来被科学史称为&quot;奇迹年&quot;（annus mirabilis）：光电效应、布朗运动、狭义相对论、质能等价，任何一篇都足以载入史册，而它们出自同一位二十六岁的年轻人之手。十年之后，他又完成了广义相对论。</p>\n<p>本 hub 以&quot;一件件代表作&quot;为单位组织：每篇文档对应一项成就，讲清三件事——它在何时、由什么问题驱动而提出，内容是什么，后来如何被实验检验。它不是物理教科书，不追求公式的完整推导，而是向一般读者还原这些成就的来龙去脉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-在爱因斯坦系列中的位置\">本 hub 在爱因斯坦系列中的位置</h2><p>爱因斯坦人物条目分为六个 facet hub，各自回答一个不同的问题。本 hub 是&quot;作品视角&quot;的入口；遇到下列侧面时，应跳转到对应兄弟 hub，避免在此重复展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁，活在怎样的时代</td>\n<td>本 hub 只谈作品本身；专利局岁月、流亡经历与公众身份在那里展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>八项科学工作的技术内核</td>\n<td>那里更深也更全（含本 hub 未展开的玻色–爱因斯坦统计、宇宙学常数与统一场论）；本 hub 按论文与事件讲代表作的来龙去脉，是更平缓的入门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他是怎么想的</td>\n<td>本 hub 谈做成了什么；思想实验、原理理论与构造理论之分等方法论在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 代表成就（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>每件代表作：何时提出、为何提出、如何被验证、获得何种认可</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他离开之后，世界如何继续被他改变</td>\n<td>本 hub 止于成就的提出与认可；百年尺度的科学、技术与文化回响在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>哪些流行叙事需要修正</td>\n<td>本 hub 采用科学史主流结论；优先权之争、米列娃问题等争论细节在那里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图-三章七篇\">内容地图：三章七篇</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 物理学革命</strong>：<a href=\"physics-revolutions/special-relativity\">狭义相对论</a>（1905，重建时空观）→ <a href=\"physics-revolutions/general-relativity\">广义相对论</a>（1915，引力即时空弯曲）→ <a href=\"physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence\">质能等价 E=mc²</a>（1905，三页论文与核时代）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 量子与统计</strong>：<a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a>（1905，光量子假说，后来的获奖理由）→ <a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/brownian-motion-statistical\">布朗运动与统计物理</a>（1905，为原子的真实存在定案）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 认可与遗产</strong>：<a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors\">诺贝尔奖与荣誉</a>（最著名的成就与获奖理由的错位）→ <a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/scientific-legacy\">科学遗产与深远影响</a>（从宇宙学到 GPS）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>快速通览（约一小时，四篇）</strong>：<a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a> → <a href=\"physics-revolutions/special-relativity\">狭义相对论</a> → <a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors\">诺贝尔奖与荣誉</a> → <a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/scientific-legacy\">科学遗产与深远影响</a>。这四篇覆盖&quot;最革命的工作、最著名的理论、最曲折的认可、最长的影响&quot;，读完即可把握全貌。</li>\n<li><strong>系统阅读（按时间线，七篇全读）</strong>：按 1905 年的投稿顺序进入奇迹年——<a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a>（3 月）→ <a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/brownian-motion-statistical\">布朗运动</a>（5 月）→ <a href=\"physics-revolutions/special-relativity\">狭义相对论</a>（6 月）→ <a href=\"physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence\">质能等价</a>（9 月）——再读十年后的<a href=\"physics-revolutions/general-relativity\">广义相对论</a>，最后以第三章的<a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors\">诺贝尔奖与荣誉</a>与<a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/scientific-legacy\">科学遗产</a>收束。</li>\n<li><strong>有物理基础的读者</strong>：直接从第一章读起，<a href=\"physics-revolutions/special-relativity\">狭义相对论</a> → <a href=\"physics-revolutions/general-relativity\">广义相对论</a> → <a href=\"physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence\">质能等价</a>；第二章可只精读光电方程与密立根验证一节。想继续深入技术细节，接<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>更关心人与故事的读者</strong>：从第三章倒读——先看<a href=\"legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors\">诺贝尔奖与荣誉</a>里&quot;最负盛名的理论偏偏没得奖&quot;的错位，再回第一章补上这些理论到底是什么；人物际遇接<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>需要</strong>：高中物理的三个概念——参考系与相对运动、能量守恒、光的波动性（干涉与衍射）；以及一点历史坐标：十九世纪末经典物理的&quot;两朵乌云&quot;、第一次世界大战（广义相对论恰在战时的柏林完成）。</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>：微积分之外的任何数学。文中公式（洛伦兹因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>、光电方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = hf - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>、质能关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）均配有文字解释，读得懂&quot;平方&quot;与&quot;正比&quot;即可跟随。</li>\n<li><strong>特别说明</strong>：不需要预先学过量子力学——<a href=\"quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect\">光电效应</a>正是量子论的入口；也不需要黎曼几何——<a href=\"physics-revolutions/general-relativity\">广义相对论</a>只要求接受&quot;物质告诉时空如何弯曲，时空告诉物质如何运动&quot;的几何图像。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨-hub-可选\">延伸阅读（跨 hub，可选）</h2><p>读完本 hub 若想继续，下列兄弟 hub 是自然的下一站：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>：作品背后的人——从乌尔姆到普林斯顿的际遇与时代。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>：作品背后的方法——追逐光束、自由落体电梯等思想实验如何工作。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>：作品之后的世界——从引力波探测到量子信息的百年回响。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physics-revolutions","title":"物理学革命","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"special-relativity","title":"狭义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/special-relativity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"general-relativity","title":"广义相对论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/general-relativity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mass-energy-equivalence","title":"质能等价 E=mc²","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-and-statistical","title":"量子与统计物理贡献","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photoelectric-effect","title":"光电效应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brownian-motion-statistical","title":"布朗运动与统计物理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/brownian-motion-statistical"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy-and-recognition","title":"影响与荣誉","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/legacy-and-recognition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nobel-prize-and-honors","title":"诺贝尔奖与荣誉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-legacy","title":"科学遗产与深远影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/legacy-and-recognition/scientific-legacy"}]}]}